   "subject": "Vectorising array of covariance matrices",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Simple question hopefully begets a simple answer: can I vectorise this model further?<div>Thanks for the great resource!</div><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">data</span> {\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">int</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">lower</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">0</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&gt;</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_obs</span>; <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">//</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">number</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">of</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">paired</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">observations</span>\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">int</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">lower</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">0</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&gt;</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>; <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">//</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">number</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">of</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">species</span>\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">int</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">lower</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&gt;</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">J</span>; <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">//</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">number</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">of</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">dimesions</span>\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">matrix</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_obs</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">J</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">y_obs</span>; <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">//</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">data</span>\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">int</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sp</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_obs</span>]; <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">//</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">species</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">index</span>\n}\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">parameters</span> {\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">vector</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">J</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">mu_sp</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>];\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">vector</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">lower</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">0</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&gt;</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">J</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sigma</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>];\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">corr_matrix</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">J</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Omega</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>];\n}\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">transformed</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">parameters</span>{\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">cov_matrix</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">J</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Sigma</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>];\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">for</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">in</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">:</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>)\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Sigma</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> quad_form_diag(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Omega</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>], <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sigma</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>]);\n}\n<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">model</span> {\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">for</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">in</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">:</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_obs</span>)\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">y_obs</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">~</span> multi_normal(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">mu_sp</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sp</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>]], <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Sigma</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sp</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>]]);\n\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">//</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">priors</span>\n  <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">for</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">in</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">:</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>){\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">mu_sp</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">~</span> normal(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">0</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">10</span>);\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">sigma</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">~</span> cauchy(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">0</span>, <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">1</span>);\n    <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">Omega</span>[<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">i</span>] <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">~</span> lkj_corr(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(0,134,179)\">2</span>);\n  }\n}</pre></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
