   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Right you are, my implementation was incorrect. I now have:<div><br><div><pre style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-family:Consolas,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,Menlo,Courier,monospace;font-size:11.9px;font-stretch:normal;line-height:1.45;word-wrap:normal;padding:16px;overflow:auto;background-color:rgb(247,247,247);border-radius:3px;word-break:normal;color:rgb(51,51,51)\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(121,93,163)\">inits</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">function</span>(){<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">list</span>(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">Lcorr</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> rep(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">list</span>(t(chol(cor(<span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">y_obs</span>)))), <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(237,106,67)\">times</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;color:rgb(167,29,93)\">=</span> <span style=\"box-sizing:border-box\">N_sp</span>))}</pre></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks for your help.</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br></div><div><br>On Monday, 30 January 2017 09:57:44 UTC+11, Ben Goodrich  wrote:</div><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>This was fixed on GitHub. <br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  }
 ]
